 bracelets and headdresses which jingle when they dance. This silver jewelry is handed down as a family heirloom.\' However, this time-reckoning system need not entail written calendars. The A-Hmao language was first written by the Pollard script in apprx. 1905.'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 1995, 'temperature': 0.2})
